@startuml Sequence_Logout
title Sequence Diagram - Logout

actor "User" as User
boundary "Navbar/Menu" as GUI
control "LogoutController" as Controller
entity "Session Data" as Session

User -> GUI: 1. Klik tombol/menu Logout
activate GUI
GUI -> Controller: 2. Request logout ke controller
activate Controller

Controller -> Session: 3. Hapus semua session data
activate Session
Session --> Controller: 4. Session dihapus
deactivate Session

Controller --> GUI: 5. Logout berhasil
deactivate Controller
GUI --> User: 6. Redirect ke halaman login atau beranda
deactivate GUI

@enduml
